<!-- wp:group {"className":"bh-client-testimonials","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group bh-client-testimonials"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Testimonials from our Clients</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"bh-testimonial-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group bh-testimonial-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Timo Vuorensola</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"bh-client-role"} --><p class="bh-client-role">Director, Jeepers Creepers Reborn</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Black Hangar rocks the studio game with a massive space for sets and huge green screen cyclorama. The staff is very experienced with digital production methods, from virtual sets to heavy VFX shoots, so it’s pretty much anything a modern filmmaker can ask for.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"bh-testimonial-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group bh-testimonial-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Alastair Eales</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"bh-client-role"} --><p class="bh-client-role">Production Manager, 97 Minutes</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Black Hangar Studios is a fantastic facility that caters for each and every production department’s requirements and makes the life of a Production Manager so much more simple! It gave me production office space and facilities for all departments. I wouldn’t hesitate to recommend Black Hangar to anyone in production thinking of basing themselves there, and look forward to the next time I can return to work there too.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"bh-testimonial-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group bh-testimonial-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Dean Fisher</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"bh-client-role"} --><p class="bh-client-role">Producer</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I have shot four projects at Black Hangar Studios so far and only had a positive experience. The crew always love coming back. The studios offers a huge versatile shooting space with all the facilities for a production on site plus plenty of parking and back lot space. The local town of Alton, great range of restaurants and lovely hotels gives the studio the edge over many others.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"bh-testimonial-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group bh-testimonial-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Josh Rappaport</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"bh-client-role"} --><p class="bh-client-role">Director</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I’m excited to have the opportunity to bring this script to life and can’t imagine a better space to do it than at Black Hangar Studios. They’ve fostered an outstanding and supportive environment with an emphasis on preparation and quality. Together, we’re going to do right by these young, wrongfully condemned soldiers.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group -->
